= run
- ##
+ ##

- Out.println(fetched)
+ Out.println(fetched)

- Out.println(attempts.show)
+ Out.println(attempts.show)

= Out.println(attempts.show)
- ```
+ ```

- The schedules which are provided, in the package `retryTenacities`, cover the usual choices:
+ Le pianificazioni fornite, nel package `retryTenacities`, coprono le scelte consuete:

= The schedules which are provided, in the package `retryTenacities`, cover the usual choices:
=
- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

= The schedules which are provided, in the package `retryTenacities`, cover the usual choices:
=
= ```tabular
- column  Given
+ column  Given

- column  Delay before a retry
- column  Attempts
- row  `exponentialForeverTenacity`  10ms, growing by a factor of 1.2 each time  unlimited
- row  `exponentialFiveTimesTenacity`  10ms, growing by a factor of 1.2 each time  5
- row  `exponentialTenTimesTenacity`  10ms, growing by a factor of 1.2 each time  10
- row  `fixedNoDelayForeverTenacity`  none  unlimited
- row  `fixedNoDelayFiveTimesTenacity`  none  5
- row  `fixedNoDelayTenTimesTenacity`  none  10
+ column  Attesa prima di un nuovo tentativo
+ column  Tentativi
+ row  `exponentialForeverTenacity`  10ms, che cresce ogni volta di un fattore 1,2  illimitati
+ row  `exponentialFiveTimesTenacity`  10ms, che cresce ogni volta di un fattore 1,2  5
+ row  `exponentialTenTimesTenacity`  10ms, che cresce ogni volta di un fattore 1,2  10
+ row  `fixedNoDelayForeverTenacity`  nessuna  illimitati
+ row  `fixedNoDelayFiveTimesTenacity`  nessuna  5
+ row  `fixedNoDelayTenTimesTenacity`  nessuna  10

